# PRIS Daily Dashboard

**Last Updated:** 2026-06-12  
**Purpose:** Single-screen operational view across PhD, LinkedIn, and Consulting engines. Open this first every working session.

---

## 🔴 Critical Path — Q3 2026

*P2 submission by 30 Sep · fsQCA case list locked · P3 scaffold begins*

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link AS "Node",
  type AS "Type",
  status AS "Status"
FROM ""
WHERE contains(file.tags, "phase/q3-2026")
SORT status ASC
```

---

## 🎓 PhD Engine — Active Work

*Papers and methods currently in motion — excludes reference nodes*

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link AS "Node",
  type AS "Type",
  status AS "Status"
FROM ""
WHERE contains(file.tags, "engine/phd")
AND (contains(file.tags, "status/drafting") OR contains(file.tags, "status/pre-draft"))
SORT status ASC
```

---

## 📱 LinkedIn Content Queue — Ready to Post

*All nodes with extractable carousel or wiki content and no gate blocking*

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  file.link AS "Node",
  type AS "Type",
  file.folder AS "Folder"
FROM ""
WHERE contains(file.tags, "content/carousel-ready")
AND contains(file.tags, "gate/open")
SORT type ASC
```

